  "instructions": [
    "Heat the ghee or oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and cook until it is lightly browned.",
    "Add the grated ginger and minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the tikka masala spice mix and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the canned diced tomatoes, chicken or vegetable broth, and salt, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the sauce for 10 minutes.",
    "Meanwhile, mix the greek yogurt and lemon juice in a bowl.",
    "Add the sliced bananas to the yogurt mixture and toss to coat.",
    "Add the banana mixture to the saucepan and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the bananas tikka masala hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro."
  ],
